<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-MTCI_5030" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283438/2" prefix="L">
<description>WE-MTCI SMT Multi-Turn Ratio coupled Inductor

Characteristics 
Smallest Coupled Inductor with different Turn Ratio and 0.8kV isolation
Magnetically Shielded
1:N Transformer
Operation temperature: -40°C to +125°C

Applications
Ideal solution for buck/boost converter with regulated and un-regulated output voltage
High density Isolated converter application (e.g. Flyback converter)
Step-up or Step-Down Converter with Auxilary winding
Can be use in Auto-transformer application

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WE-MTCI

Updated by Ella 2026-07-22
2026(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
